{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-68",
  "title": "The State of Public Access TV",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The State of Public Access TV"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Public access TV, once a vibrant platform for local content, is facing challenges in the digital age. However, it remains relevant, providing a voice for marginalized communities, serving as an educational tool, and supporting digital literacy."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To embrace the future, public access TV needs to:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Integrate with digital platforms**: Stream or host content online and leverage social media for engagement."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Focus on unique content**: Highlight hyper-local news, local sports, and community issues."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Partner with local organizations**: Collaborate with newspapers, universities, and community groups to expand reach."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Despite the rise of online media, public access TV has potential if it adapts to changing viewing habits and embraces its local focus. By providing a platform for diverse voices and fostering community connection, it can continue to play a role in a dynamic media landscape."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Local News**: Hyper-local news, including community events, local sports, and school news."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Community Events**: Live coverage of community events, such as town hall meetings, school board meetings, and local government meetings."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Local Programming**: Original programming, including documentaries, talk shows, and educational programs produced by local volunteers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Digital Literacy**: Tutorials on how to use digital devices, software, and social media platforms."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Digital Media Production**: Courses on how to produce digital media, such as video production, audio production, and graphic design."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Community Engagement**: Tools and resources for community engagement, such as online forums, chat rooms, and social media groups."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}